# Build tooling lives in the context because it operates on `sandbox/` and
# `verifier-data/`, but none of it belongs in the image. The Dockerfile copies
# named subdirectories rather than the context root, so today none of this is
# reachable anyway — this file is here so that staying unreachable does not
# depend on nobody ever adding a broader COPY.
#
# `*.py` matches only the context root: mockaws/*.py is unaffected and still
# ships to /opt/mockaws.
*.py
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
